## 3. Flutter Configuration

In [app_config.dart](file:///e:/spy_projects/wtf_flutter_test/shared/lib/utils/app_config.dart#L4-L35), `AppConfig.remoteTokenServerUrl` is now set to `https://tokenserver-tau.vercel.app` by default:

```dart
class AppConfig {
  static const String remoteTokenServerUrl = String.fromEnvironment(
    'TOKEN_SERVER_URL',
    defaultValue: 'https://tokenserver-tau.vercel.app',
  );
  ...
}
```

### Running on Any Device
Both **Guru App** and **Trainer App** now automatically connect to your production Vercel server when run on:
- Chrome / Web browsers
- Physical Android & iOS phones
- Android & iOS Emulators
- Windows & macOS Desktop
